---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../components/CtaBanner.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Nadine Kay" description="The story behind Nadine Kay's handmade bath bombs.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs font-semibold mb-3 text-center" style="color:var(--color-accent);">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold mb-8 text-center" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);">About Nadine Kay</h1>

    <div class="flex justify-center mb-10">
      <img src="/logo.png" alt="Nadine Kay" class="h-40 w-40 rounded-full object-cover shadow-xl" />
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none text-[color:var(--color-text)] space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Nadine Kay started with a simple idea: bath time should feel like a small luxury, not an afterthought.
        Every bath bomb, soap, and scrub is mixed and poured by hand in small batches, using real ingredients we're
        happy to put on our own skin &mdash; shea butter, coconut oil, and skin-loving oils, with no shortcuts.
      </p>
      <p>
        What started as a kitchen-counter hobby has grown into a small business built on care: for the ingredients,
        for the craft, and for the people who use what we make. We test every scent and color combination ourselves
        before it ever reaches the shop.
      </p>
      <p>
        Thank you for supporting a small, handmade business. We can't wait for you to feel good and smell good, too.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBanner
    heading="Curious about a custom order?"
    subheading="Custom colors, scents, and gift bundles are always welcome."
    buttonLabel="Get in Touch"
    buttonHref="/contact"
  />
</BaseLayout>
